Author: yunjinqi <yunjinqi@qq.com>
Date:   Fri Oct 16 11:45:37 2026 +0800

    fix(registry): adopt released strategy write runs through durable re-claim
    
    - _claim_strategy_write: an active claim now refuses plainly (DUPLICATE_ACTIVE_RUN,
      empty result); when every other run is released and exactly one exists, refuse
      with result.strategy_write_run_id so the caller can adopt; racing adopters
      serialize inside BEGIN IMMEDIATE
    - service_runtime: ServiceRuntimeError.result (default {}); _rpc attaches the
      control-failure result; strategy-port registration retries once with the adopted
      run id; definitive control rejections unchanged
    - Evidence: tests/unit/test_service_risk_only_order_integration.py 20 passed on this
      tree (D:/temp/it10reg32-20261016-r2 run1, exit 0); independent review GO
      (.codex-tmp/reg32-review-status.md sha256 68b240ef77d96d4090132ea6dc6795f38e06999c7659ccc5b987ded8035e6972)
    - Pre-existing reds on dev HEAD, not caused by this change: test_service_config_scoped_execution_routes.py
      (test-local close_clients stub rejects the allowed_call_errors kwarg) and
      test_service_host_integration.py (account_owner RESOURCE_KEYS_MISMATCH; test predates
      the 4-key builtin); repairs in flight

